Here's the problem file for the task of trashing the book:

```pddl
(define (problem trash_book_problem)
  (:domain robot2)
  (:objects
    robot2 - robot
    Book - object
    GarbageCan - object
    SideTable - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot2 SideTable)
    (at-location Book SideTable)
    (at-location GarbageCan SideTable)
    (not (inaction robot2))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location Book GarbageCan)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.